Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:05.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S01E01: The Pilot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:05.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》  第一季  第1集  序集
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.45,0:00:10.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ So no one told you life was gonna be this way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.45,0:00:10.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}♪ 没有人告诉你活着有多累
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.52,0:00:15.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Your job's a joke, you're broke, your love life's D.O.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.52,0:00:15.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}♪ 上班受罪  口袋空空  爱情变累赘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.54,0:00:15.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：詹妮弗·安妮斯顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:20.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ It's like you're always stuck in second gear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:20.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}♪ 寂寞又潦倒  受气又受累
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.41,0:00:18.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：柯特妮·考克斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.87,0:00:22.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ When it hasn't been your day,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.87,0:00:22.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}♪ 日复一日  年复一年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.13,0:00:22.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：丽莎·库卓）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.97,0:00:25.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ your week, your month, or even your year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.97,0:00:25.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}♪ 时运不济  活着受罪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.97,0:00:29.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ but I'll be there for you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.97,0:00:29.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}♪ 你我永不离弃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.59,0:00:28.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：马特·勒布朗）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.93,0:00:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ When the rain starts to pour
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.93,0:00:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}♪ 纵有狂风暴雨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.89,0:00:32.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：马修·派瑞）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:34.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ I'll be there for you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:34.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}♪ 你我永不离弃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.85,0:00:36.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：大卫·修蒙）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:36.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Like I've been there before
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}♪ 支持一如往昔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.72,0:00:39.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ I'll be there for you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.72,0:00:39.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}♪ 你我永不离弃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:43.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪  'Cause you're there for me too
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:43.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}♪ 你我相偎相依
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.28,0:00:48.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.11,0:00:51.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's nothing to tell. It's just some guy I work with.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.11,0:00:51.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么好说的！他只不过是我的同事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:54.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on. You're going out with a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:54.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}少来了，和你交往的男人…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.45,0:00:56.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's gotta be something wrong with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.45,0:00:56.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多多少少一定有点问题！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:00:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So does he have a hump and a hair piece?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:00:59.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他既驼背又戴假发？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.54,0:01:02.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait. Does he eat chalk?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.54,0:01:02.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下，他是不是会吃粉笔？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.17,0:01:07.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't want her to go through what I went through with Carl. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.17,0:01:07.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是不希望你 重蹈我和卡尔的覆辙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.25,0:01:05.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（制片：塔德·史帝文斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.59,0:01:10.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, everybody relax. This is not even a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.59,0:01:10.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位放轻松，这不算约会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.59,0:01:13.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just two people going out to dinner and not having sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.59,0:01:13.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过是两个人一起出去吃晚餐 而且不上床
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:15.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sounds like a date to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:15.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对我来说这就是约会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.76,0:01:17.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（编剧：玛莎·卡夫曼　大卫·肯蓝）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.18,0:01:21.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm back in high school, in the middle of the cafeteria...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.18,0:01:21.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}做了个梦，在中学时代 我站在餐厅中央…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:24.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I realize I'm totally naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:24.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}突然发现自己全身赤裸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.77,0:01:26.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, yeah. - I've had that dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.77,0:01:26.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 对，没错 - 我做过那样的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.52,0:01:30.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then I look down and I realize there is a phone...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.52,0:01:30.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我低头一看，看见有一个电话…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:33.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:33.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.07,0:01:35.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Instead of... - That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.07,0:01:35.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 而不是… - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:37.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: That one, I've never had. PHOEBE: No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:37.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我没做过那样的梦 - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.87,0:01:42.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All of a sudden, the phone starts to ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.87,0:01:42.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}突然，那个电话响了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.21,0:01:43.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And it turns out it's my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.21,0:01:43.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结果是我妈妈打来的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:50.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which is very, very weird because she never calls me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:50.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这非常奇怪 因为她从来都不会打电话给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.30,0:01:53.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（导演：詹姆斯·柏洛斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.01,0:01:56.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.01,0:01:56.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.93,0:02:01.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This guy says "hello," I wanna kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.93,0:02:01.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这家伙说〝嗨〞的时候 我却想杀了我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.39,0:02:02.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you okay, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.39,0:02:02.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还好吧，亲爱的？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:07.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I feel like someone grabbed my small intestine, pulled it out of my mouth...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:07.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就感觉好像某人伸手进我的喉咙 抓住我的小肠，从我的嘴里拉出来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.65,0:02:10.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and tied it around my neck. - Cookie?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.65,0:02:10.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 再在我的脖子上打结… - 要吃饼干吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.53,0:02:14.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Carol moved her stuff out today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.53,0:02:14.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}卡萝今天搬走了她的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.24,0:02:15.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PHOEBE & JOEY: Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.24,0:02:15.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.45,0:02:17.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Let me get you some coffee. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.45,0:02:17.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我给你拿杯咖啡 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.20,0:02:21.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ew. Unh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.20,0:02:21.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}呃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:26.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. No, don't! Stop cleansing my aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:26.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，不要！ 不要清理我的光环！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just leave my aura alone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要管我的光环，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:33.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll be fine. All right? Really. I hope she'll be very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:33.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会没事的，好吗？真的 我希望她开心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.97,0:02:35.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No, you don't. - No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.97,0:02:35.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不，你并不希望 - 是的，我不希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.47,0:02:37.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To hell with her. She left me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.47,0:02:37.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}叫她去死，是她离开了我！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.35,0:02:40.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you never knew she was a lesbian.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.35,0:02:40.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你从来都不知道她是女同性恋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:46.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No! Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:46.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道！行了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:49.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why does everyone keep fixating on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么每个人老是要提出来？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.11,0:02:53.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She didn't know. How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.11,0:02:53.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她都不知道，我又怎么会知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.74,0:02:58.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sometimes I wish I was a lesbian.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.74,0:02:58.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有时候我希望我是女同性恋…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:02.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did I say that out loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:02.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我讲得很大声吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.95,0:03:08.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, Ross. Look, you're feeling a lot of pain right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.95,0:03:08.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事的，罗斯 你现在感到很痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:10.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're angry. You're hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:10.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你很生气，很伤心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:13.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I tell you what the answer is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:13.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我能告诉你解决方法是什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.30,0:03:14.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Strip joints!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.30,0:03:14.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}脱衣舞厅！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.76,0:03:19.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, you're single. Have some hormones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.76,0:03:19.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别这样，你单身了！有需求的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:21.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, but I don't want to be single, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:21.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想单身，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.81,0:03:24.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just wanna be married again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.81,0:03:24.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只想…再次结婚！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.10,0:03:32.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I just want a million dollars!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.10,0:03:32.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而我只想要一百万美金！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.36,0:03:34.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.36,0:03:34.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.61,0:03:37.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God, Monica! Hi! Thank God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.61,0:03:37.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，老天爷，摩妮卡 感谢上帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.49,0:03:40.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I went to your building and this guy with a hammer said...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.49,0:03:40.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚到你那里去，而你不在 那个拿着大锤子的家伙说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.82,0:03:43.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that you might be here, and you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.82,0:03:43.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可能在这里 你真在这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.29,0:03:46.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Can I get you some coffee? - Decaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.29,0:03:46.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你想喝点咖啡吗？ - 无咖啡因的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:51.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, everybody, this is Rachel, another Lincoln High survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:51.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了，各位，这位是瑞秋 另一个林肯高中的幸存者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:54.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is everybody. This is Chandler and Phoebe...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:54.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就是各位 这是钱德、菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:56.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and Joey. And remember my brother, Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:56.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊，还有 你还记得我哥哥罗斯吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.67,0:03:57.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Sure! - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.67,0:03:57.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 当然，嘿！ - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.97,0:03:59.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hi. - Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.97,0:03:59.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嗨 - 天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.68,0:04:11.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you wanna tell us now, or are we waiting for four wet bridesmaids?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.68,0:04:11.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你现在可以告诉我们了吗 还是说我们在等着四位湿漉的伴娘?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:18.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God! Well, it started about a half-hour before the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:18.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，大概在婚礼前半个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.65,0:04:21.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was in this room with all the presents...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.65,0:04:21.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在礼物间里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.24,0:04:23.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I was looking at this gravy boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.24,0:04:23.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看着那个肉汁壶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.28,0:04:26.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This really gorgeous Limoges gravy boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.28,0:04:26.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是个非常好看的肉汁壶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.87,0:04:28.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When all of a sudden... Sweet 'N Low?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.87,0:04:28.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后，突然…　有代糖吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.87,0:04:31.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I realized...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.87,0:04:31.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我发现…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.17,0:04:35.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I was more turned on by this gravy boat than by Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.17,0:04:35.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我对这个肉汁壶 比对巴瑞更有冲动！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:38.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then I got really freaked out, and that's when it hit me:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:38.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后我吓呆了 然后这个想法突然出现在脑中：
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.47,0:04:41.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How much Barry looks like Mr. Potato Head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.47,0:04:41.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}巴瑞看起来多像洋芋头先生啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.68,0:04:44.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I mean, I always knew he looked familiar, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.68,0:04:44.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我总是觉得他眼熟，但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.10,0:04:50.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, I just had to get out of there, and I started wondering:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.10,0:04:50.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之 我必须离开那里，我在想：
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.69,0:04:54.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Why am I doing this?" And "Who am I doing this for?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.69,0:04:54.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝我为什么这样做，我为谁这样做？〞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:58.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, I just didn't know where to go, and I know you and I have drifted apart...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:58.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道该去哪里 而且我知道我和你有点疏远了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:05:01.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but you're the only person I know in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:05:01.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你是我这个城市里唯一认识的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:03.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who wasn't invited to the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:03.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且没有受邀参加你的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.12,0:05:07.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I was kind of hoping that wouldn't be an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.12,0:05:07.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，我希望你不会把它当一回事…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.22,0:05:23.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm guessing he bought her the big pipe organ...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.22,0:05:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我猜他给她买了个管风琴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.89,0:05:26.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and she's really not happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.89,0:05:26.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而她很不喜欢那个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.60,0:05:30.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Daddy, I just... I can't marry him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.60,0:05:30.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老爸，我就是无法和他结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.81,0:05:32.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.81,0:05:32.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:35.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just don't love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:35.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是不爱他了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:38.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it matters to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:38.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这对我很有关系！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:43.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHANDLER: She should not be wearing those pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:43.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她真不应该穿那条裤子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:46.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I say push her down the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:46.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得应该把她推下楼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.91,0:05:50.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ALL: Push her down the stairs! Push her down the stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.91,0:05:50.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把她推下楼…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.37,0:05:56.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, Daddy, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.37,0:05:56.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}爸爸，听我说！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.59,0:06:01.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like all of my life, everyone's always told me, "You're a shoe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.59,0:06:01.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就好像在我一生中 所有人都告诉我：〝你是鞋子！〞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:03.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're a shoe! You're a shoe! You're a shoe!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:03.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝你是鞋子…〞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.59,0:06:06.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then today I stopped and said, "What if I don't wanna be a shoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.59,0:06:06.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后今天，我停下来对自己说： 〝如果我不想成为鞋子呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.97,0:06:10.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if I wanna be a purse? You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.97,0:06:10.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我想成为一个包包？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.31,0:06:12.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or a hat?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.31,0:06:12.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或一顶帽子？〞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.02,0:06:15.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't want you to buy me a hat, I am a hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.02,0:06:15.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，我不是要你给我买帽子 我是说我是帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.73,0:06:17.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a metaphor, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.73,0:06:17.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是个比喻，爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:21.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can see where he'd have trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:21.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看得出他哪里听不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:26.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, Daddy, it's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:26.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}爸爸，这是我的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.99,0:06:30.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, maybe I'll just stay here with Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.99,0:06:30.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许我可以和摩妮卡住在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.46,0:06:35.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess we've established she's staying with Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.46,0:06:35.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我猜我们已经确定 她要和摩妮卡住在一起了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:40.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, maybe that's my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:40.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许那是我的决定
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.42,0:06:43.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, maybe I don't need your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.42,0:06:43.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许我不需要你的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.84,0:06:46.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait! Wait! I said maybe!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.84,0:06:46.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等！我说也许！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.06,0:06:55.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Just breathe, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.06,0:06:55.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}呼吸，呼吸 好，就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.48,0:06:57.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just try to think of nice, calm things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.48,0:06:57.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}试着想一些让你镇定的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.15,0:07:02.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Raindrops on roses And whiskers on kittens
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.15,0:07:02.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}玫瑰上的雨滴，还有猫的胡须
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:06.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doorbells and sleigh bells And something with mittens
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:06.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}门铃和雪橇铃，还有手套…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.11,0:07:10.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}La la la something With string
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.11,0:07:10.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啦啦啦，还有一些条状物…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:12.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm all better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:12.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我现在好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:16.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:16.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我帮上忙啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:20.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: Look, this is probably for the best, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:20.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瞧，这也许对你来讲是最好的 知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.67,0:07:23.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Independence. Taking control of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.67,0:07:23.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}独立了，把握自己的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:27.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And, hey, if you need anything, you can always come to Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:27.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有，你还需要什么 你可以随时来找乔伊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:31.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me and Chandler live right across the hall. And he's away a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:31.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我和钱德就住在对面 而且他经常不在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:35.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey, stop hitting on her. It's her wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:35.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊，不要再对她放电了 今天是她结婚的日子！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:37.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? Like there's a rule or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:37.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么啦，难道这还有什么规定吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:44.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please don't do that again. It's a horrible sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:44.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请不要再按了 那是很恐怖的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.19,0:07:46.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PAUL: Uh, it's Paul. - Buzz him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.19,0:07:46.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我是保罗 - 让他进来！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.90,0:07:49.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Who's Paul? - Paul, the wine guy, Paul?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.90,0:07:49.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 谁是保罗？ - 保罗，红酒达人，保罗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.41,0:07:50.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.41,0:07:50.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.66,0:07:53.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait a minute. Your "not a real date" is with Paul, the wine guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.66,0:07:53.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等，你今晚的〝不是真正约会〞 是和红酒达人保罗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:55.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- He finally asked you out? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:55.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 他终于约你出去啦？ - 是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:57.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh. This is a "Dear Diary" moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:57.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是个可以写入日记的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.46,0:08:00.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rach, wait, I can cancel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.46,0:08:00.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋，等等，我可以取消…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.21,0:08:03.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please, no. Go, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.21,0:08:03.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用 你去吧，我不会有事的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.17,0:08:06.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, are you okay? I mean, do you want me to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.17,0:08:06.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯，你没事吧？ 你希望我留下来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.76,0:08:09.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That'd be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.76,0:08:09.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能留下就太好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:14.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Really? - No, go on! It's Paul, the wine guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:14.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 真的？ - 不，去吧！那可是红酒达人保罗耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.85,0:08:20.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: Hi, come in. Paul, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.85,0:08:20.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}进来，保罗，这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.15,0:08:23.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...everybody. Everybody, this is Paul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.15,0:08:23.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家 各位，这是保罗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.15,0:08:25.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}JOEY: Paul, the wine guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.15,0:08:25.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}保罗！红酒达人！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:29.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Wine guy. - I didn't catch your name. Paul, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:29.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 红酒达人！ - 我没听清楚你的名字，是保罗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.66,0:08:32.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Okay. Sit down. Two seconds. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.66,0:08:32.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 请坐，两秒钟就好 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:39.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, I just pulled out four eyelashes. That can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:39.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚拔掉四根睫毛不是个好兆头
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, Rachel, what are you up to tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么瑞秋，你今晚…打算做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:48.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I was supposed to be headed for Aruba on my honeymoon...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:48.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我本来应该到阿鲁巴度蜜月
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.42,0:08:49.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.42,0:08:49.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以，没事做！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.89,0:08:54.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right. You're not even getting your honeymoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.89,0:08:54.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对呀，你连蜜月都无法去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.39,0:08:58.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God. No, no. Although, Aruba. Heh. This time of year? Eh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.39,0:08:58.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过，阿鲁巴，这个时候？
