Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.26,0:13:42.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝比利，别逞英雄〞 这句话对你有没有意义？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.34,0:13:48.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, here's the thing. Even if I could get it together enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.34,0:13:48.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是这样的，就算我想…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.02,0:13:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to ask a woman out...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.02,0:13:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}约一个女人出来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.02,0:13:54.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who am I gonna ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.02,0:13:54.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该约谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.75,0:14:17.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Isn't this amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.75,0:14:17.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是不是很不可思议？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:19.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, I have never made coffee before in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:19.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以前从来没泡过咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.80,0:14:22.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- That is amazing. - Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.80,0:14:22.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 是很不可思议 - 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.51,0:14:27.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}While you're on a roll, if you feel like you gotta make a Western omelet or something...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.51,0:14:27.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你现在刚好有心情 有没有想做个蛋饼之类的东西…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:33.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Although, actually I'm really not that hungry this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:33.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过我还不太饿…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:35.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Good morning. MONICA: Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:35.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 早安 - 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:37.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Morning.  - JOEY: Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:37.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 早安  - 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:40.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Morning. JOEY: Morning, Paul.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:40.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 早安 - 早安，保罗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.90,0:14:44.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hello, Paul. - Hi. Paul, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.90,0:14:44.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你好，保罗 - 嘿，是保罗，对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.24,0:14:50.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: I had a really great time last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.24,0:14:50.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我昨晚很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:53.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PAUL: Thank you. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:53.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你!太感谢你了!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:56.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- We'll talk later, okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:56.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 再聊 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.30,0:15:03.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.30,0:15:03.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.97,0:15:11.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That wasn't a real date.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.97,0:15:11.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是真正的约会！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:15.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What the hell do you do on a real date?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:15.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你真正的约会都在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.19,0:15:19.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Shut up and put my table back. JOEY: Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.19,0:15:19.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 闭嘴，把我的桌子搬回去 - 好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:21.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, kids, I gotta get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:21.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好啦，孩子们，我要去工作啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.90,0:15:27.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I don't input those numbers, it doesn't make much of a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.90,0:15:27.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过如果我不把那些数字输入 也不会有什么差别
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.45,0:15:32.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, like, you guys all have jobs?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.45,0:15:32.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们都有工作吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.37,0:15:35.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, we all have jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.37,0:15:35.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，我们都有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.25,0:15:37.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, that's how we buy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.25,0:15:37.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样我们才有钱买东西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:40.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I'm an actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:40.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，我是演员
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:43.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow. Would I have seen you in anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:43.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇，我有见过你的作品吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:45.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I doubt it. Mostly regional work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:45.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦，应该没有，大部分是地方性节目
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.97,0:15:49.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unless you happened to catch the Wee One's production of Pinocchio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.97,0:15:49.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等，除非你看过 翻拍的《木偶奇遇记》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.80,0:15:52.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Look, Geppeto. I'm a real live boy."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.80,0:15:52.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝瞧，老木匠，我是个真正的小男孩〞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.18,0:15:56.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I will not take this abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.18,0:15:56.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别这样羞辱我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.14,0:15:59.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.14,0:15:59.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错，对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.48,0:16:02.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Once I was a wooden boy A little wooden boy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.48,0:16:02.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我曾经是个小木偶…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.28,0:16:08.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: So how are you doing today? Did you sleep okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.28,0:16:08.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你今天怎么样？睡得好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.82,0:16:12.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you talk to Barry? I can't stop smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.82,0:16:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和巴瑞谈过吗?我无法停止微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.95,0:16:16.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can see that. You look like you slept with a hanger in your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.95,0:16:16.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看得出来，就好像你睡觉时 有个衣架在你嘴里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.09,0:16:25.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. He's just so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.09,0:16:25.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道，他只是太…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:27.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remember you and Tony De Marco?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:27.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还记得你和托尼多马哥吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.47,0:16:31.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, yeah. - Well, it's like that. With feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.47,0:16:31.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 是的，记得 - 就好像那样，但有感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.35,0:16:34.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, wow, are you in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.35,0:16:34.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇，你有麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:38.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, okay. I am just going to get up, go to work...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:38.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，我要醒过来，去工作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.64,0:16:41.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and not think about him all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.64,0:16:41.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且不要整天想着他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or else I'm just gonna get up and go to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或者只是站起来去工作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.65,0:16:46.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, wish me luck! - What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.65,0:16:46.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 喔，祝我好运！ - 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:49.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna go get one of those job things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:49.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要去找工作之类的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:17:00.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey, Monica. - Hey, Franny. Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:17:00.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿，摩妮卡！ 嘿，弗兰妮，欢迎回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.54,0:17:02.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How was Florida?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.54,0:17:02.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佛罗里达怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.21,0:17:03.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You had sex, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.21,0:17:03.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟人上床了，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.42,0:17:06.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.42,0:17:06.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.59,0:17:11.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- So, who? - You know Paul?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.59,0:17:11.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 那么，是和谁？ - 你认识保罗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.93,0:17:13.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Paul, the wine guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.93,0:17:13.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}保罗，红酒达人？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.68,0:17:15.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah, I know Paul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.68,0:17:15.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的，我认识保罗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.81,0:17:20.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You mean, you know Paul like I know Paul?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.81,0:17:20.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你认识他就好像我认识他一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:22.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you kidding? I take credit for Paul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:22.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你开玩笑吧？保罗还欠我人情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.98,0:17:27.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Before me, there was no snap in his turtle for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.98,0:17:27.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在我之前，他两年都无法行房
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:32.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course it was a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:32.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那当然是谎言！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:35.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why? Why would anybody do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:35.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？为什么有人会做这样的事情？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:39.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're looking for an answer more sophisticated than:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:39.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想更精确的答案是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.62,0:17:41.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"To get you into bed."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.62,0:17:41.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝为了和你上床〞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:44.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:44.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是因为我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.33,0:17:47.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it like I have some sort of beacon that only dogs...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.33,0:17:47.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是因为我会散发某种信号吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.05,0:17:50.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and men with severe emotional problems can hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.05,0:17:50.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只有狗和有感情问题的男人 才会感应到？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.88,0:17:52.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, come here. Give me your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.88,0:17:52.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好啦，过来这里，把你的脚给我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.31,0:18:02.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just thought he was nice, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.31,0:18:02.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是以为他是个好人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.02,0:18:07.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe you didn't know it was a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.02,0:18:07.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真不敢相信 你不知道那是谎言！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:13.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Guess what.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:13.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}猜猜怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.57,0:18:15.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You got a job? - Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.57,0:18:15.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你找到工作啦？ - 开玩笑吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.53,0:18:17.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm trained for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.53,0:18:17.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一点经验都没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.04,0:18:21.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was laughed out of 12 interviews today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.04,0:18:21.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我今天被十二个面试员嘲笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.25,0:18:22.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yet you're surprisingly upbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.25,0:18:22.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且你还这么高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:26.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you would be too if you found Joan and David boots on sale...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:26.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你也会高兴的 如果你发现名牌皮靴特价…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.67,0:18:28.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...50 percent off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.67,0:18:28.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}打五折！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.63,0:18:30.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, how well you know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.63,0:18:30.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是呀，你真了解我…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.09,0:18:34.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're my new "I don't need a job or my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.09,0:18:34.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这双是 〝我不需要工作，我不需要父母
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:36.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've got great boots" boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:36.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我买了新皮靴〞的皮靴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.30,0:18:40.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- How'd you pay for them? - Uh, credit card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.30,0:18:40.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你用什么付帐的？ - 信用卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.06,0:18:42.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And who pays for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.06,0:18:42.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那谁付帐单呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.39,0:18:45.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.39,0:18:45.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.06,0:18:50.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't live off your parents your whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.06,0:18:50.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能靠你爸爸过一辈子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.44,0:18:54.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know that. That's why I was getting married.
