Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.33,0:19:02.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I remember when I first came to this city, I was 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.33,0:19:02.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记得我第一次来这个城市 我才十四岁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:05.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My mom had killed herself and my stepdad was back in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:05.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妈妈刚自杀 我的继父又进了监狱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.25,0:19:07.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I got here, and I didn't know anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.25,0:19:07.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后在这里我不认识任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.46,0:19:10.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I ended up living with this albino guy who was cleaning windshields...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.46,0:19:10.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后我和一个在港务局 给人擦车窗的…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.00,0:19:14.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...outside Port Authority. And then he killed himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.00,0:19:14.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}白化病人住在一起 最后他也自杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.55,0:19:19.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then I found aromatherapy. So believe me, I know exactly how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.55,0:19:19.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后我找到按摩这份工作 所以相信我，我完全了解你的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.52,0:19:26.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The word you're looking for is:
